msgstr "Hindi sinabi ng plugin na ito kung bakit. Magpadala ng ulat ng diagnostics at titingnan namin."

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-connection.php:161
msgid "Connection status"
msgstr "Katayuan ng koneksyon"

#. translators: %s: a human-readable interval such as "5 minutes".
#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-connection.php:189
#, php-format
msgid "Last checked %s ago."
msgstr "Huling sinuri %s ang nakalipas."

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-connection.php:251
msgid "(opens in a new tab)"
msgstr "(bubukas sa bagong tab)"

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-diagnostics.php:199
msgid "Send this to Zinn® support"
msgstr "Ipadala ito sa suporta ng Zinn®"

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-diagnostics.php:201
msgid "This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it."
msgstr "Ito mismo ang ipapadala — wala nang iba, at walang nakatago. Wala rito ang iyong mga password, token, at API key."

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-diagnostics.php:204
msgid "The diagnostics report that will be sent"
msgstr "Ang ulat sa diagnostics na ipapadala"

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-diagnostics.php:207
msgid "Copy to clipboard"
msgstr "Kopyahin sa clipboard"

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-diagnostics.php:214
msgid "Send this report to Zinn® support"
msgstr "Ipadala ang ulat na ito sa suporta ng Zinn®"

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-diagnostics.php:216
msgid "We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself."
msgstr "Magbubukas kami ng support ticket para sa iyo at sasagot sa pamamagitan ng email. Kung mas gusto mong huwag itong ipadala, kopyahin ito sa itaas at i-paste ito sa ticket nang ikaw mismo."

#. translators: %s: the transport error reported by WordPress.
#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-diagnostics.php:270
#, php-format
msgid "We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong."
msgstr "Hindi namin maabot ang Zinn Digital® mula sa server na ito (%s). Kopyahin ang ulat sa itaas at magbukas na lang ng ticket — walang mali sa iyong mga setting."

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-diagnostics.php:284
msgid "Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email."
msgstr "Naipadala na. Natanggap na ng suporta ng Zinn® ang iyong ulat at sasagot sa pamamagitan ng email."

#. translators: %s: the support reference for the report just sent.
#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-diagnostics.php:287
#, php-format
msgid "Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email."
msgstr "Naipadala na. Natanggap na ng suporta ng Zinn® ang iyong ulat — sanggunian %s — at sasagot sa pamamagitan ng email."

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-diagnostics.php:296
msgid "You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive."
msgstr "Nagpadala ka ng ilang ulat sa maikling panahon. Maghintay ng ilang minuto at subukang muli — nakarating naman ang mga nauna."

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-diagnostics.php:303
msgid "Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket."
msgstr "Hindi matanggap ng Zinn Digital® ang ulat ngayon — sa amin ang problema, hindi sa iyo. Subukang muli mamaya, o kopyahin ang ulat sa itaas sa isang ticket."

#. translators: %d: the HTTP status code the server returned.
#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-diagnostics.php:311
#, php-format
msgid "The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number."
msgstr "Tinanggihan ang ulat (HTTP %d). Kopyahin ito sa itaas at magbukas ng ticket, na binabanggit ang numerong iyon."

#. translators: %s: the Zinn Digital trade mark, which is not translated.
#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-promo.php:326
#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-promo.php:384
#, php-format
msgid "%s — guides and services"
msgstr "%s — mga gabay at serbisyo"

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-promo.php:341
msgid "User guides"
msgstr "Mga gabay ng user"

#. translators: %s: this plugin's name, e.g. "Zinn® Cache".
#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-promo.php:391
#, php-format
msgid "Read the %s user guide"
msgstr "Basahin ang gabay sa gumagamit ng %s"

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-promo.php:399
msgid "Hide this"
msgstr "Itago ito"

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-promo.php:512
msgid "Zinn® hosting for WordPress"
msgstr "Zinn® hosting para sa WordPress"

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-promo.php:513
msgid "LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site."
msgstr "LiteSpeed, mga pang-araw-araw na backup, libreng paglipat, at isang control panel na binuo para sa mga taong nagpapatakbo ng higit sa isang site."

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-promo.php:519
msgid "The Zinn® marketplace"
msgstr "Ang marketplace ng Zinn®"

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-promo.php:520
msgid "Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy."
msgstr "Bumili at magbenta ng mga naitatag nang site, domain, at placement ng link, kung saan ligtas na hawak ang pera hanggang sa maging masaya ang magkabilang panig."

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-promo.php:567
msgid "Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living"
msgstr "Zinn Hub® — kumuha ng mga taong ito ang ikinabubuhay"

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-promo.php:568
msgid "Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid."
msgstr "Ang aming pambuong-mundong freelance marketplace: mag-browse sa mahigit 10,000 handang serbisyo mula sa mga manunulat, designer, developer, at SEO specialist, o mag-post ng proyekto at hayaan silang mag-bid."

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-style-presets.php:118
msgid "Style preset"
msgstr "Preset ng estilo"

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-style-presets.php:119
msgid "A starting point. Anything below overrides it."
msgstr "Isang panimulang punto. Anumang nasa ibaba ay magpapawalang-bisa rito."

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-style-presets.php:126
msgid "Use my own colours and sizes"
msgstr "Gamitin ang sarili kong mga kulay at laki"

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-style-presets.php:127
msgid "Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is."
msgstr "Iwanan itong naka-off at gagamitin ang preset nang eksakto kung ano ito."

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-updater.php:253
msgid "See the Zinn Digital® release notes."
msgstr "Tingnan ang mga tala sa paglabas ng Zinn Digital®."

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-updater.php:302
msgid "The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again."
msgstr "Hindi nagbigay ang serbisyo sa pag-update ng Zinn® ng link sa pag-download para sa pag-update na ito. Suriin kung naaabot ng site na ito ang platform ng Zinn®, pagkatapos ay subukang muli."

#. translators: %s: the download error reported by WordPress.
#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-updater.php:316
#, php-format
msgid "The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes."
msgstr "Hindi ma-download ang update mula sa serbisyo ng pag-update ng Zinn® (%s). Subukan ulit pagkalipas ng ilang minuto."

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-updater.php:330
msgid "The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed."
msgstr "Bumagsak ang na-download na update sa pagsusuri sa integridad nito at hindi na-install."

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-ability.php:94
msgid "The action could not be completed. Try again, and if it keeps failing, contact the site administrator."
msgstr "Hindi makumpleto ang aksyon. Subukan muli, at kung patuloy itong mabigo, makipag-ugnayan sa administrator ng site."

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-oauth.php:704
#: includes/mcp-kit/class-oauth.php:715
msgid "Connect an AI app"
msgstr "Magkonekta ng isang AI app"

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-oauth.php:717
#: includes/mcp-kit/class-oauth.php:723
#: includes/mcp-kit/class-oauth.php:764
msgid "This connection request has expired. Go back to the app and start connecting again."
msgstr "Nag-expire na ang kahilingang ito sa koneksyon. Bumalik sa app at magsimulang kumonekta muli."

#. translators: 1: the AI app's name, 2: the plugin's MCP server name, 3: the WordPress user's display name.
#: includes/mcp-kit/class-oauth.php:731
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s is asking to use %2$s on this site as %3$s. It can do only what your WordPress account is allowed to do, and you can disconnect it at any time from the AI agents (MCP) settings."
msgstr "Humihiling ang %1$s na gamitin ang %2$s sa site na ito bilang %3$s. Magagawa lamang nito kung ano ang pinapayagang gawin ng iyong WordPress account, at maaari mo itong idiskonekta anumang oras mula sa mga setting ng AI agents (MCP)."

#. translators: 1: the AI app's name, 2: a domain name.
#: includes/mcp-kit/class-oauth.php:734
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s identified itself from %2$s."
msgstr "Ipinakilala ng %1$s ang sarili nito mula sa %2$s."

#. translators: 1: the AI app's name, 2: a domain name.
#: includes/mcp-kit/class-oauth.php:737
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s registered itself automatically. Only continue if you started this from %2$s."
msgstr "Awtomatikong nagparehistro ang %1$s. Magpatuloy lamang kung sinimulan mo ito mula sa %2$s."

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-oauth.php:741
msgid "Your account cannot use these tools on this site. Ask an administrator."
msgstr "Hindi maaaring gamitin ng iyong account ang mga tool na ito sa site na ito. Magtanong sa isang administrator."

#. translators: %s: a domain name.
#: includes/mcp-kit/class-oauth.php:744
#, php-format
msgid "After you answer you will go back to %s."
msgstr "Pagkatapos mong sumagot babalik ka sa %s."

#. translators: %s: the AI app's name.
#: includes/mcp-kit/class-oauth.php:749
#, php-format
msgid "Allow %s"
msgstr "Payagan ang %s"

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-oauth.php:750
msgid "Do not allow"
msgstr "Huwag payagan"

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-rest-bridge.php:325
msgid "A required value is missing or has the wrong form. Check the ability's input schema."
msgstr "May nawawalang kinakailangang value o mali ang anyo nito. Suriin ang input schema ng kakayahan."

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-rest-bridge.php:358
msgid "The site refused the request."
msgstr "Tinanggihan ng site ang kahilingan."

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:118
msgid "Unknown tool."
msgstr "Hindi kilalang tool."

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:315
msgid "Let AI assistants such as Claude, Cursor or VS Code work on this site for you through MCP (Model Context Protocol). They sign in as a WordPress user (Claude and ChatGPT by approving them here, others with an application password) and can do only what that user is allowed to do."
msgstr "Pahintulutan ang mga AI assistant tulad ng Claude, Cursor, o VS Code na magtrabaho sa site na ito para sa iyo sa pamamagitan ng MCP (Model Context Protocol). Nagsa-sign in sila bilang isang WordPress user (ang Claude at ChatGPT sa pamamagitan ng pag-apruba sa kanila rito, ang iba ay gamit ang application password) at magagawa lamang kung ano ang pinapayagang gawin ng user na iyon."

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:317
msgid "AI agents need WordPress 6.9 or later. Update WordPress to use them."
msgstr "Kailangan ng mga AI agent ang WordPress 6.9 o mas bago. I-update ang WordPress para magamit ang mga ito."

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:330
msgid "Connection address (MCP endpoint)"
msgstr "Address ng koneksyon (MCP endpoint)"

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:334
msgid "Claude and ChatGPT: sign in instead"
msgstr "Claude at ChatGPT: mag-sign in na lang"

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:335
msgid "Add the connection address as a custom connector in Claude, or as an app in ChatGPT developer mode. They open this site so you can approve them; no password to copy."
msgstr "Idagdag ang address ng koneksyon bilang isang custom na connector sa Claude, o bilang isang app sa developer mode ng ChatGPT. Binubuksan nila ang site na ito para maaprubahan mo ang mga ito; walang password na kokopyahin."

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:337
msgid "AI apps connected to your account:"
msgstr "Mga AI app na nakakonekta sa iyong account:"

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:346
msgid "Disconnect"
msgstr "Idiskonekta"

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:352
msgid "Other AI apps: an application password"
msgstr "Iba pang mga AI app: isang password ng application"

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:354
msgid "Create an application password for your user"
msgstr "Gumawa ng password ng application para sa iyong user"

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:355
msgid "Add this to your AI app’s MCP settings, with your username and that password:"
msgstr "Idagdag ito sa mga setting ng MCP ng iyong AI app, kasama ang iyong username at ang password na iyon:"

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:357
msgid "VS Code: put the same entry under \"servers\" in .vscode/mcp.json, not under \"mcpServers\"."
msgstr "VS Code: ilagay ang parehong entry sa ilalim ng \"servers\" sa .vscode/mcp.json, hindi sa ilalim ng \"mcpServers\"."

#. translators: %d: how many tools an AI agent can use.
#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:361
#, php-format
msgid "Tools an AI agent can use here (%d):"
msgstr "Mga tool na maaaring gamitin ng isang AI agent dito (%d):"

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:372
msgid "User guide: AI agents and MCP"
msgstr "Gabay ng gumagamit: Mga AI agent at MCP"

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:375
msgid "Developer docs: abilities, REST and MCP"
msgstr "Mga doc ng developer: mga kakayahan, REST at MCP"

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:54
msgid "Manage your hosting clients, their plans and their sites on Zinn Digital® from this site."
msgstr "Pamahalaan ang iyong mga kliyente sa pag-host, ang kanilang mga plano at kanilang mga site sa Zinn Digital® mula sa site na ito."

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:60
msgid "Your clients, their plans and their sites, through your Zinn Digital® reseller account."
msgstr "Ang iyong mga kliyente, ang kanilang mga plano at kanilang mga site, sa pamamagitan ng iyong Zinn Digital® reseller account."

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:108
msgid "Read your reseller account"
msgstr "Basahin ang iyong reseller account"

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:109
msgid "Returns your reseller account in one read: brand, plans, clients and services counts, and what is set up."
msgstr "Ibinabalik ang iyong reseller account sa isang pagbasa: brand, mga plano, bilang ng mga kliyente at serbisyo, at kung ano ang naka-set up."

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:115
msgid "List your clients"
msgstr "Ilista ang iyong mga kliyente"

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:116
msgid "Lists your client accounts, a page at a time (cursor, limit)."
msgstr "Inililista ang iyong mga client account, nang paisa-isang pahina (cursor, limit)."

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:122
msgid "Create a client"
msgstr "Gumawa ng client"

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:123
msgid "Creates a client account under yours (name; default_currency, a three-letter code). Put them on a plan before their first site."
msgstr "Gumagawa ng client account sa ilalim ng account mo (name; default_currency, isang tatlong-titik na code). Ilagay sila sa isang plano bago ang kanilang unang site."

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:142
msgid "Read a client's plan"
msgstr "Basahin ang plano ng isang kliyente"

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:143
msgid "Returns which plan a client is on and what it costs you (client_id)."
msgstr "Ibinabalik kung aling plano naroroon ang isang kliyente at kung magkano ang gastos nito sa iyo (client_id)."

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:149
msgid "Put a client on a plan"
msgstr "Maglagay ng kliyente sa isang plano"

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:150
msgid "Puts a client on one of your plans (client_id, plan_code; interval: month or year). Do this before their first site."
msgstr "Inilalagay ang isang kliyente sa isa sa iyong mga plano (client_id, plan_code; interval: month o year). Gawin ito bago ang kanilang unang site."

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:172
msgid "List the plans you can sell"
msgstr "Ilista ang mga planong maaari mong ibenta"

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:173
msgid "Lists the hosting plans and their prices (product_line and currency narrow it)."
msgstr "Inililista ang mga plano sa pag-host at ang kanilang mga presyo (nililimitahan ito ng product_line at currency)."

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:187
msgid "List your clients' sites"
msgstr "Ilista ang mga site ng iyong mga kliyente"

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:188
msgid "Lists everything you have provisioned for your clients (client_id and status narrow it), a page at a time."
msgstr "Inililista ang lahat ng na-provision mo para sa iyong mga kliyente (nililimitahan ito ng client_id at status), nang tig-isang pahina bawat pagkakataon."

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:199
msgid "Create a site for a client"
msgstr "Gumawa ng site para sa isang kliyente"

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:200
msgid "Creates a hosted site for one of your clients (client_id, product_line, primary_domain). It is billed to your account at the client's plan, as from your shop."
msgstr "Lumilikha ng isang hosted site para sa isa sa iyong mga kliyente (client_id, product_line, primary_domain). Sisingilin ito sa iyong account batay sa plano ng kliyente, tulad ng mula sa iyong tindahan."

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:220
msgid "Suspend a client's site"
msgstr "Isuspinde ang site ng kliyente"

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:221
msgid "Puts a client's site on a non-payment hold (site_id; reason: your own note, never shown to the client). The site stops serving until it is unsuspended."
msgstr "Inilalagay ang site ng kliyente sa hold dahil sa hindi pagbabayad (site_id; reason: sarili mong tala, hindi kailanman ipinapakita sa kliyente). Hihinto ang site sa pagseserbisyo hanggang sa maalis ang pagkakasuspinde nito."

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:239
msgid "Unsuspend a client's site"
msgstr "I-unsuspend ang site ng isang kliyente"

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:240
msgid "Lifts a non-payment hold, so the site serves again (site_id)."
msgstr "Tinatanggal ang hold dahil sa hindi pagbabayad, upang muling gumana ang site (site_id)."

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:249
msgid "Read the Reseller Toolkit settings"
msgstr "Basahin ang mga setting ng Reseller Toolkit"

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:250
msgid "Returns this plugin's settings (the API address, the plan new orders use, which features are on). The API key is never returned, only whether one is saved."
msgstr "Ibinabalik ang mga setting ng plugin na ito (ang address ng API, ang planong ginagamit ng mga bagong order, kung aling mga feature ang naka-on). Hindi kailanman ibinabalik ang API key, kundi kung may naka-save lamang."

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:256
msgid "Change the Reseller Toolkit settings"
msgstr "Baguhin ang mga setting ng Reseller Toolkit"

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:257
msgid "Changes the settings you send (plan_code, enable_domain_search, enable_panel_link, enable_woocommerce) and keeps the rest. The API key and address are changed on the screen only."
msgstr "Binabago ang mga setting na ipapadala mo (plan_code, enable_domain_search, enable_panel_link, enable_woocommerce) at pinapanatili ang iba pa. Ang API key at address ay binabago sa screen lamang."

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:306
msgid "Add your Zinn Digital® reseller API key on the Reseller Toolkit screen first."
msgstr "Idagdag muna ang iyong Zinn Digital® reseller API key sa screen ng Reseller Toolkit."
